Flynn is a member of [[Org/Iconoclasm/index|Iconoclasm]] who joined near the start, when [[Org/Iconoclasm/People/Illmari Vaino|Illmari]] first called for anyone willing to look into the [[Phenomena/Harmony/Voidsong|Voidsong]].

Months ago he was dragged through the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sewers|sewers]] beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], leaving a trail of fairy dust and blood.
